### Variables
@baseUrl = https://api.hourledger.local.com/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1. Authenticate / Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@mail.com",
    "password": "power@123"
}

### 2. List Invoices (with search, sort, filter, and pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?search=&sort_by=issue_date&sort_direction=desc&page=1&per_page=15
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Next Invoice Number for Client
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/next-number?client_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create Invoice (Auto-generated code like C1-I001)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "client_id": 1,
    "issue_date": "2026-10-23",
    "due_date": "2026-11-06",
    "currency": "USD",
    "tax_percentage": 5,
    "discount_amount": 0,
    "status": "draft",
    "notes": "Invoice generated for monthly services",
    "items": [
        {
            "description": "Custom Software Engineering",
            "unit": "hour",
            "quantity": 20,
            "unit_price": 120.00,
            "product_service_id": null
        }
    ]
}

### 5. Create Invoice with Custom Number (Explicit client_invoice_number: 5 -> #C1-I005)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "client_id": 1,
    "client_invoice_number": 5,
    "issue_date": "2026-10-23",
    "due_date": "2026-11-06",
    "currency": "USD",
    "tax_percentage": 0,
    "discount_amount": 50,
    "status": "sent",
    "notes": "Custom numbered invoice",
    "items": [
        {
            "description": "Architecture Review",
            "unit": "unit",
            "quantity": 1,
            "unit_price": 750.00,
            "product_service_id": null
        }
    ]
}

### 6. Get Invoice Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Update Invoice
PUT {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "status": "sent",
    "notes": "Updated invoice notes"
}

### 8. Download Invoice Markdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1/download-markdown
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. Delete Invoice
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
